# Charmonium peaking background for B+ -> K*+ l+ l-:
# B+ -> J/psi(-> l+ l-) K*+, same visible final state as the signal.
# Vetoed in real analyses with windows in m(l+l-).

Alias      B+sig        B+
Alias      B-sig        B-
ChargeConj B+sig        B-sig

Alias      J/psisig     J/psi
ChargeConj J/psisig     J/psisig

Alias      K*+sig       K*+
Alias      K*-sig       K*-
ChargeConj K*+sig       K*-sig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
0.500  B+sig B-                      VSS;
0.500  B-sig B+                      VSS;
Enddecay

Decay B+sig
1.000  J/psisig K*+sig               SVV_HELAMP 0.6417 3.29 0.7556 0.0 0.1312 0.13;
Enddecay
CDecay B-sig

Decay J/psisig
0.500  e+  e-                        PHOTOS VLL;
0.500  mu+ mu-                       PHOTOS VLL;
Enddecay

Decay K*+sig
0.500  K+    pi0                     VSS;
0.500  K_S0  pi+                     VSS;
Enddecay
CDecay K*-sig

End
